            "url": "https://api.dane.gov.pl/1.4/datasets/1694",
            "reviewedAt": "2026-11-07",
            "note": "Dataset 1694 licenses outbound car/truck waits under CC BY 4.0 and identifies website/service numerical data as identical. Resource 19712 describes the interface; it is not a separate observation grant or a blanket website licence. Only PL→UA passenger cars and DMC >7.5t freight at units 401030, 401060 and 303020 are included. Estimates are waiting to begin clearance, not total crossing duration. Warsaw wall time is an adapter interpretation; ambiguous dates/times fail closed. Eight daily updates intentionally leave gaps under the unchanged two-hour source-age deadline. One shared GET every 30 minutes is a conservative choice, not a stated provider quota. Coordinates are separately curated Wikidata CC0 with revision evidence.",
